      "message": "Merge issue/992-thread-undrilled into issue/985-external-threads\n\ngenerate.rs (Thread arm): keep both - a boss keeps #985's own crest\nregion; a hole takes #1205's round-wall gate (walls_round) on the crest\nregion. thread_op.rs: root_cutter takes both `round` (#1205) and the\nexternal depth (#985). hole_wall_flats.rs: the new `external: false`\nfield on its Thread params.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
