      "message": "test(thread): pin the stamp digest of `external`\n\n`stamp_follows_every_input` now checks that toggling `external` on a\nThread op with identical holes moves the stamp, so the 0xE7 write in\nthe Thread arm of `operation/params.rs` cannot be dropped silently\n(M3's review of PR #1137). Mutation: with the write removed the test\nfails (\"toggling external moves the stamp\").\n\nRefs #985\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
